			The page you asked for does not exist — it may have been renamed, or never pushed in the first
			place.
		</p>
		<p style="margin-top:26px">
			<a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Back home</a>
			<a href="/writing/" class="btn btn-ghost">Browse writing</a>
		</p>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
